0..75 Comment "// An extension type stated by its `ext` member: `ext Cell = Val on left is"
76..148 Comment "// zero` declares the sort of cells of `Val` fixed to `zero` on the face"
149..228 Comment "// `left`, and the face theory generates its signature — `inCell` introducing"
229..307 Comment "// a cell by its values off the face, `outCellp` reading it at each point `p`,"
308..388 Comment "// and the boundary, β and η laws among the block\'s rules (Tesla Zhang, _Three"
389..465 Comment "// non-cubical applications of extension types_, arXiv:2311.05658). Over two"
466..537 Comment "// points it is the signature `zero-fiber.gandr` writes by hand (#641)."
539..615 Comment "/// The cells of `Val` over `Two` fixed to `zero` on `left`, with `c` a cell"
616..694 Comment "/// nothing introduces. The boundary reads `zero` at `left` of every cell, `c`"
695..774 Comment "/// included; β reads an introduced cell\'s value at the point off the face; η"
775..816 Comment "/// rebuilds a cell from its value there."
817..819 Other "@["
820..830 Other "normalizes"
830..831 Other "("
831..832 StringLit "\""
832..917 StringLit "cells(outCell0(c), outCell1(inCell(one)), inCell(outCell1(c))) ~> cells(zero, one, c)"
917..918 StringLit "\""
918..919 Other ")"
920..921 Other "]"
